<p>current share:    well under 1% of NZ shell-egg-equivalent volume (specialty / free-from channel).</p>
<p>products IN market: - Orgran Easy Egg (shelf-stable powder; broadest distribution) - just Egg (US-origin liquid; specialty / online only in NZ) - OGGS (predominantly vegan baking) - Crackd (UK-stocked; not NZ-stocked at field date)</p>
<p>awareness / trial (Wave 11 Egg Addendum sec. 1):</p>
