<p>Calthorpe Part 5 [00:06:02]: &quot;What I&#x27;d watch is the signal Foodstuffs and Woolworths NZ send when they decide whether to range a plant-based egg SKU in the chilled or shelf-stable section of the egg shelf. That moment - when the supermarket decides the category needs a plant-based offer alongside the shell-egg block - is when the substitution risk goes from theoretical to material. We&#x27;re not there in NZ yet.&quot;</p>
