<h3>5. Aurora exposure read-throughs (Calthorpe Part 5)</h3>
<p>product mix exposure (Part 5 [00:35:48]):</p>
<p>- No meaningful pasture-raised SKU at last check. - No meaningful omega-3 enriched SKU at last check. - Approximately 50%+ of Aurora&#x27;s free-range pack is commodity free-range (the cost-of-living-elastic tier). - Aurora is therefore long the consumer-elastic end of premium and short the consumer-durable end. Post-acquisition uplift opportunity in premium-tier extension (pasture-raised, omega-3); confirmatory should validate the absence of pasture-raised / omega-3 SKUs and quantify launch capex / timing.</p>
